          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "a6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " atacando el peón de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "b6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", y el rey negro tiene que quedarse cerca para defenderlo. El alfil blanco da un rodeo hasta "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " para atacar el peón de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "g6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", y el caballo negro tiene que defenderlo desde "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Ahora las negras están en "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "zugzwang",
            "text": "zugzwang"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": si mueve el caballo, el alfil se come los peones de ese lado."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "With pawns on both sides of the board, the bishop usually beats the knight: it crosses the board in a single move. Fischer against Taimanov, fourth game of their 1971 match. The white king is already on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "a6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " attacking the pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "b6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", and the black king has to stay close to defend it. The white bishop takes a detour to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " to attack the pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "g6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", and the black knight has to defend it from "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Now Black is in "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "zugzwang",
            "text": "zugzwang"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": if the knight moves, the bishop eats the pawns on that side."
          }
        ]
      },
