    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Contra un alfil malo, el caballo es muy fuerte. Aquí el alfil negro de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " va por casillas claras, igual que todos los peones negros: solo puede moverse a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". El caballo blanco puede saltar a casillas oscuras, que ese alfil no podrá atacar nunca. Y fíjate en el rey blanco: ya está en el centro, listo para entrar. En el final, el rey es una pieza más; sácalo, tengas alfil o caballo."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Against a bad bishop, the knight is very strong. Here the black bishop on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " moves on light squares, like all the black pawns: it can only move to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The white knight can jump to dark squares, which that bishop will never be able to attack. And look at the white king: it is already in the centre, ready to walk in. In the endgame the king is one more piece; bring it out, whether you have a bishop or a knight."
          }
        ]
      },
